  "title": "Bottom Bar",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Bottom Bar"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The **Bottom Bar** component defines a fixed bottom navigation container with five action slots."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In Figma, this component is defined as a `COMPONENT` (`Bottom_Bar`) without root variants or root component properties."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It contains five `Bottom_Bar_Button` instances arranged horizontally."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Source: [Bottom_Bar in Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/3hGC1ju0d5AKzaoI9pKIyu/PFB---Design-System?node-id=2064-65)"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Anatomy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Each bottom bar contains:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "**Container** (`COMPONENT`, `440 x 80`)"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "**Five button slots** (`Bottom_Bar_Button` instances)"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "**Per-button icon slot** (`INSTANCE`, default icon component)"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "**Per-button text label** (`TEXT`, default `Text`)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Component API"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The root `Bottom_Bar` component does not expose root-level component properties. Available properties are exposed by each nested `Bottom_Bar_Button` item."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Properties"
    },
