        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Discrepancias detectadas"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Discrepancia",
        "Impacto",
        "Accion pendiente",
        "Estado"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Container background is hardcoded as `#ECECEC` instead of using a semantic token.",
          "Reduces token governance consistency and theme portability.",
          "Map container background to a semantic token or document this as an accepted exception.",
          "`open`"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Usage Guidelines"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "**When to use**: Use as primary bottom navigation for mobile layouts with persistent destinations."
        },
        {
          "text": "**When not to use**: Do not use as a contextual action toolbar or for transient feedback actions."
        },
        {
          "text": "**Do**: Keep a stable action count and order."
        },
        {
          "text": "**Do**: Keep exactly one item in `Selected` state for the current destination."
        },
        {
          "text": "**Don't**: Use long labels that wrap or clip in item cells."
        },
        {
          "text": "**Don't**: Mix unrelated action types in the same bar."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Content Guidelines"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Use concise labels (prefer one short word or short phrase)."
        },
        {
          "text": "Use sentence case or title case consistently across all items."
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep labels semantically distinct to avoid ambiguous navigation choices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Accessibility"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "1. ARIA role and semantics"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Expected container role: `role=\"navigation\"` (implementation-level, `TBD` pending audit)."
        },
        {
          "text": "Item semantics should be interactive controls (for example buttons/links) in implementation."
        },
        {
          "text": "Required ARIA attributes for current implementation are `TBD`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "2. Keyboard navigation"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "header": [
        "Key",
        "Action"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`Tab`",
          "Moves focus between interactive items"
        ],
        [
          "`Enter`",
          "Activates focused item"
        ],
        [
          "`Arrow keys`",
          "`TBD` (optional pattern, pending implementation decision)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3. Focus management"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Focus order should follow visual item order from left to right."
        },
        {
          "text": "No focus behavior is explicitly defined in Figma; implementation details are `TBD`."
        },
        {
          "text": "Focus outline tokens should use `Semantic.Color.Focus-Outline.Inner` and `Semantic.Color.Focus-Outline.Outer`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "4. Labeling"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Each item label should be unique and meaningful."
        },
        {
          "text": "Icon-only usage is not defined; if introduced, labeling strategy is `TBD`."
        },
        {
          "text": "`aria-describedby` usage is `TBD`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "5. Contrast and visibility"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Selected vs non-selected states must remain distinguishable without relying on color alone."
        },
        {
          "text": "Contrast verification is `TBD (pending audit)`."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Hit area requirements"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Desktop minimum hit area token: `A11y.A11y.modeDesktop.Dimension.Min-Hit-Area` (`TBD` resolved value)."
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobile minimum hit area token: `A11y.A11y.modeMobile.Dimension.Min-Hit-Area` (`TBD` resolved value)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Related Components"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "[Status Bar](status_bar.md): Use together with bottom navigation in full mobile chrome compositions."
        },
        {
          "text": "[Alert](alert.md): Use for contextual feedback, not for destination switching."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Gaps / TBD"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Item-level token differences for `Default` vs `Selected` are `TBD` in current docs."
        },
        {
          "text": "Root-level selected-index control is not exposed as a single property in this component."
        },
        {
          "text": "No badge/counter slot is defined for notifications."
        },
        {
          "text": "No documented dark-mode variant for the root container."
        },
        {
          "text": "No explicit overflow behavior is defined for long labels."
        }
      ]
    }
